      "evidence_id": "EV_001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Yes. I brought notes. I'm starting a placement as a dental nurse on Monday, and the occupational health form needs my hepatitis B immunity status. I had the three injections as a student, but I don't have the paperwork.",
